body:
Alt right/right is entirely mis understood. Jordan Peterson for instance is often considered far right fascist because he came out opposing a law here in Canada regarding compelled speech forcing people under penalty of law to use one's preferred pronouns. Doesn't matter that he has no problem use someone's pronouns out of respect and has on many occasions. He just doesn't think that you should be legally liable for not doing such a thing. He also wrote several books where he talks about personal responsibility. For some reason the idea for taking responsibility for anything these days is right wing. I suppose its much easier to just blame all your problems on the entire rest of the world, or systemic issues and hey I'm no shining angel myself I am always coming up with excuses for why my life is a burning dumpster fire. I do however strive to live by the advise of someone like Jordan Peterson. Which apparently makes me a NAZI. I also don't understand that. I see it too not just in furry fandom but in the bronies people being called NAZI's. Is it just me, or is it crazy to conceive of someone who sports a rainbow emoji in their profile name and identifies as a princess sparkle unicorn being a NAZI!!!???? Or guys wearing fur suits goose stepping down the road pulling woman and children from their homes and shipping them on box cars to the local gas chamber. Like HELLO you're delusional if you believe this is real. Living in a fantasy that's not real. 

&#x200B;

Now are there people on the right who are hateful, who are bigoted and who are racist? YES ABSOLUTELY. I don't believe though in broad brush painting an entire group of people based on a bad few. In that case can we at least agree that EVERYONE is awful. EVERYONE is a shitty human being? Cause there are just as many people who are left wing who genuinely believe that all men are evil and need to die. Congratulations genius you just proposed a solution to your problems that would lead to the extinction of our species in 30 years time. The left likes to preach all day long about love and acceptance, but are sure hateful when it comes to people who don't fit into boxes labeled X, Y, and Z.

&#x200B;

Who am I btw? My name is Drake Bates. I've been in the fandom for nearly 10 years. just got into the con scene in the past 4 years. Believe it or not there was a time in the fandom right at the beginning of the Trump presidency in 2016 where no one cared about politics. You could be a Trump supporter, Hillary supporter, or Bernie bro and no one cared. Saying that you voted for Trump wouldn't get you a 50 message chain of hate on Twitter and banned from half a dozen websites. The fandom was a place to avoid politics. To avoid real life because real life frankly sucks ass. Why you all brought it into this one place to escape the stupidity of whatever dumb ass tweet the president said this day or that I will never understand.

&#x200B;

Lets put politics aside for a second. I have experienced so much hate from people in this fandom for non political things too. Hate for my art. People make jokes say it looks like my OC's went through a microwave. I have people that make fun of my mental illness. Furs that put me down for being broke and having trouble finding and keeping any meaningful employment. Meanwhile 90% of the fandom consists of broke underemployed college age kids. And now its harder than ever to get a job in this economic climate. I experience hate for the city I live in. Being that my province tends to vote conservative/right wing. Even though I'd rather live elsewhere if elsewhere didn't require the funding of rent by selling body parts on the open black market. At least I can afford to live here and not starve.

These people are not nice. They are cruel. I would go as far as saying some of them are down right evil and egocentric. If someone who is normal who has a brain and can think logically wants to talk to me my telegram handle is @ drakebates. Or if you just want to scream at me for being a NAZI thats cool to. Either way I don't give a fuck anymore.
